# Golden images — banned. All test verification must use logical assertions
# (pixel values, OCR text output) instead of screenshot comparison.
# See docs/standards/QUALITY-GATE.md for the full policy.
# Suffix-only: already-tracked files are unaffected.
*.mp4
*.png
*.raw

# Font files — banned. Fonts SHALL be installed via Nix (flake.nix).
# See docs/standards/QUALITY-GATE.md for the full policy.
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.eot

# Infrastructure files — not tracked in repo
.gitattributes
.githooks/
.constraints.toml
ultracode/
.workflow/
.reasonix/
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
generated-patches/
.cache/

# round-214: user-mandated test artifacts (screenshots/video for selection verification)
# NOTE: exception removed — media files (png/mp4) are banned from git (FR-055); deleted from history


# Freetype golden fixtures: generated by tests at runtime (non-deterministic)
native/test_data/*.rgba
native/test_data/*.meta

# cargo-llvm-cov raw profile dumps (generated by coverage runs)
*.profraw
